---
// Original teaching diagram: the lesson's F0 example, not a machine capture.
const groups = [
  { label: 'High nibble', positions: [7, 6, 5, 4], bits: '1111', digit: 'F', value: '15 × 16 = 240' },
  { label: 'Low nibble', positions: [3, 2, 1, 0], bits: '0000', digit: '0', value: '0 × 1 = 0' },
];
---
<figure class="hex-byte">
  <div class="diagram" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="direction">Read left to right →</p>
    <p class="position-label">Bit positions (7 down to 0)</p>
    <div class="nibbles">
      {groups.map(group => (
        <div class="nibble">
          <div class="positions">{group.positions.map(position => <span>{position}</span>)}</div>
          <div class="bits">{[...group.bits].map(bit => <span>{bit}</span>)}</div>
          <div class="connector">↓</div>
          <span class="diagram-label">{group.label}</span>
          <strong class="digit">{group.digit}</strong>
          <span class="value">{group.value}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="total">HEX F0 = 240 + 0 = 240</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Read the eight bits from left to right, from position 7 to position 0.
    The high nibble, 1111, becomes F (fifteen); the low nibble, 0000, becomes 0.
    The left hex digit counts in sixteens, so F0 is 15 × 16 + 0 = 240.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>@layer blocks {
  .hex-byte { margin: var(--h-space-8) 0; padding: clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); border: 1px solid var(--h-line); background: var(--h-ground); break-inside: avoid; }
  .diagram { color: var(--h-ink); text-align: center; }
  .direction { margin: 0 0 var(--h-space-4); font-weight: 600; }
  .position-label, .diagram-label { font-size: var(--h-text-small); }
  .position-label { margin: 0 0 var(--h-space-2); }
  .nibbles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--h-space-4); }
  .positions, .bits { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); font-family: var(--h-font-mono); }
  .positions { font-size: var(--h-text-small); }
  .bits { padding: var(--h-space-2) 0; border: 1px solid var(--h-ink-muted); font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 32px); line-height: 1.4; }
  .connector { line-height: 1.4; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .diagram-label, .digit, .value { display: block; }
  .digit { font-family: var(--h-font-mono); font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .value { font-size: var(--h-text-small); }
  .total { margin: var(--space-5) 0 0; font-family: var(--h-font-mono); font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 18px); }
  figcaption { margin-top: var(--space-5); color: var(--h-ink-body); font-size: var(--h-text-small); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 64ch; }
}
</style>
